不能全部浸透在水中，莫忆儿只好坐在温润的水中，然后再撩起水来清洗自己。当洗到胸前的两朵小蜜桃（说是蜜桃已经夸大了）的时候，她森森的觉得，自己的胸部真的很小。以前倒是没觉得，不过来了这里，女人们毫不介意的把至少D罩杯的胸部露出来，对她来说算得上是个不小的打击。一边感慨，一边舒舒服服的洗了个原生态溪水澡，莫忆儿从溪水里面走出来，摸了摸依旧湿答答的睡衣，有些郁闷。衣服只有一件，不知道能穿多久，还是要珍惜一点才好。直接去小溪边的草丛踩了把叶片宽大的草叶，准备弄个草裙穿。不过，这东西还是真的不好弄，没经验啊。“莫忆儿，你洗好了吗？”已经过了好半天，太阳都快下山了，幡戈终于忍不住在远处大喊，怕莫忆儿生气，他并不敢探出脑袋来看。此刻的莫忆儿还在和草做斗争，终于能把草穿到身上，不过她很担心，毕竟是草，会不会一走就掉下来？还有胸部遮挡的几个大树叶，是用长草穿起来绑在身上的，怎么看怎么不安全！“莫忆儿……”幡戈又在叫了。莫忆儿终于犹豫着，拿起自己半干的睡衣和小内内朝他走去。待快走到近前的时候，幡戈问：“我可以回头看你吗？”“噗！”这原始人还真是可爱啊，“可以了，我都走过来了！”其实，耳力好的幡戈早就听到了，只是没确定之前，他不敢轻举妄动罢了。这位天上掉下来的人脾气真是暴躁，和自己的阿兄差不多呢！转过身来，看着穿着长草的莫忆儿，幡戈觉得亲切多了，毕竟那奇怪的兽皮他还是第一次见到，宽宽大大的，都不确定莫忆儿是不是女人。“我们回去吧，让桑贞找条兽皮给你，现在我们部族富有了，大家都不穿草叶了。”莫忆儿使劲的点头，兽皮比草叶安全系数高多了。于是两人并肩往山洞走去，还没走到山洞，就听见山洞方向一派欢腾，幡戈的脚步也快了许多，他高高的，步子很大，莫忆儿只有小跑才能追得上。“喂，怎么了？你走这么快做什么？”“快，好像是首领回来了。”除了迎接满载而归的狩猎部族人，就只有首领回来能让族人这么高兴了。莫忆儿只能跟着幡戈大大的步伐，一路小跑着往回赶，心里对这个原始部落的首领也颇为好奇。果然，山洞的洞口二十多个族人围在一起，一阵欢声笑语，几位老人也都离开了洞穴，出来迎接他们最敬爱的首领。莫忆儿在人群中间看到了几个生面孔，其中一个又高又大，差不多快要190cm了，一脸风尘仆仆的，所以人都对着他笑，莫忆儿有一种感觉，他也许就是这个部族的首领。在他的身边还站着一个女人，身材也很健硕，180cm左右，头发乱蓬蓬的，肌肤竟然比男人们还要黑一些。正在打量这个女人，就感觉一道犀利的目光射向自己，莫忆儿需找目光的主人，竟是那个个子最高大的男人。他的目光犀利并且危险，就像是野兽一样。“幡戈，她是谁！”男人开口，所有的人都静了下来，顺着男人的目光看向莫忆儿。幡戈怔了怔，发现所问的人是莫忆儿，忙笑着回答：“首领楚炑，我正要告诉，这位是莫忆儿！”“莫忆儿？”这个男人果然就是首领，他准确的叫出莫忆儿的名字，目光中更带着几分审视和满满的戒备，对这个突如其来的人表现得并不欢迎。“她从哪里来？”“别担心，我们的首领！小剌剌看到她是从天上坠下的，是神灵的人，她会给部族带来好运！”咖萨笑着对楚炑解释，眼中憧憬着莫忆儿会给他们带来的好运。楚炑似乎不以为然，好看的眉毛轻挑，大步走到莫忆儿身前，上下打量了她一番，然后问：“神灵的人还穷到需要穿草裙吗？”莫忆儿被他的话问得嘴角抽搐，她已经不好奇这个首领了，而是很讨厌，一副狂妄自大的样子，真是让人受不了。“是啊，我不会打猎，所以很穷，只能穿这样的草裙！”这句话倒是让楚炑觉得有趣，目光落到了她手里抱着的睡衣上，问：“这是什么？”“没什么……”莫忆儿才不想告诉他。“首领，她刚刚去洗这个奇怪的兽皮，我们该给她找条兽皮裙换洗才行！”幡戈察觉出莫忆儿和楚炑两个人之间的不对劲，忙对楚炑说，然后背对着莫忆儿，给他使眼色。“好吧，去给这个……莫忆儿准备条兽皮裙吧，这点我们部族还是能拿的出来的，不过要想用诡计在我们部族得到什么，那简直是做梦。”很显然，楚炑在怀疑莫忆儿，根本不相信她是神灵的人。的确，她莫忆儿不是，不过，她也从来没说过自己是神灵的人，只是他们听说自己是从天上掉下来，自己就认定了。凭什么来质疑自己？讨厌的家伙，一点都不可爱！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/sifuzhengchong-mengguaifujunyangchengji/6.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 6: Very poor, can only wear grass skirts - After thinking about it, Mo Yi'er did not tell Ban Ge that she was not a god. In fact, this was also good for herself. At least they would treat her well and she would not starve to death for the time being. As a girl in the 21st century, hunting is simply too far away. Even if you have to learn to be self-reliant here, you can't learn it in a short while. \"Okay, okay, I know, I won't leave. Stay away, I want to wash...the animal skins and myself!\" \"Really? You really won't leave?\" Bange's eyes were bright, full of surprise. \"Really, I promise, I won't leave now, I will only wash the animal skins here!\" Primitive people are very simple and don't have as many ideas as modern people. They are very committed and will do what they say, so he chose to believe in Mo Yi'er. \"I'll wait for you over there. If anything happens, just scream and I'll help you!\" After saying that, he ran to the tree in the distance with a smile. The tree was so big that three or four people holding hands could barely hold it up. Bange was sitting on the other side of the tree, honestly, and the trunk of the tree obscured his figure and gaze. Mo Yi'er exhaled and suddenly felt that primitive people were a little cute. Take off your pajamas and wash yourself quickly. Well, there is also little Nenei. In the past few days, she has been saving water from the leaves of big trees to clean little Nenei. However, there is too little water, so she must wash her well today. I washed my underwear and pajamas and hung them on the stone to dry before cleaning myself. The overflowing water from the pool slowly flowed down and did not form a deep channel, so the whole body could not be immersed in the water. Mo Yi'er had to sit in the warm water and then pick up the water to clean herself. When she saw the two small peaches on her chest (calling them peaches is an exaggeration), she felt deeply that her breasts were really small. She didn't think so before, but when she came here, the women showed no problem at least D-cup breasts, which was a big blow to her. While sighing, Mo Yi'er took a comfortable bath in the original stream water. Mo Yi'er walked out of the stream and touched her still wet pajamas, feeling a little depressed. I only have one piece of clothing, and I don’t know how long it will last, so I’d better cherish it. I went directly to the grass beside the stream and stepped on some wide blades of grass, preparing to get a grass skirt to wear. However, this thing is still really difficult to handle, and I have no experience. \"Mo Yi'er, have you finished washing?\" A long time had passed and the sun was almost setting. Ban Ge finally couldn't help shouting in the distance. He was afraid that Mo Yi'er would be angry, so he didn't dare to stick his head out to see. At this moment, Mo Yi'er was still struggling with the grass, and finally she was able to wear the grass on her body, but she was worried, after all, it was grass, would it fall off as soon as she walked away? There are also several large leaves covering the chest, which are made of long grass and tied to the body. It seems unsafe! \"Mo Yi'er...\" Bange called again. Mo Yi'er finally hesitated, picked up her half-dried pajamas and little underwear and walked towards him. When he was almost close, Bange asked: \"Can I look back at you?\" \"Pfft!\" This primitive man is really cute, \"Okay, I've already walked over!\" In fact, Bange, who has good ears, had heard it a long time ago, but he didn't dare to act rashly until he was sure. This man who fell from the sky has a really bad temper, almost like his own brother! Turning around and looking at Mo Yi'er, who was wearing long grass, Ban Ge felt more friendly. After all, it was the first time he had seen that strange animal skin. It was so wide that he was not sure whether Mo Yi'er was a woman. \"Let's go back and ask Sang Zhen to find an animal skin for you. Now that our tribe is rich, everyone no longer wears grass blades.\" Mo Yi'er nodded vigorously. Animal skins are much safer than grass blades. So the two of them walked side by side towards the cave. Before they reached the cave, they heard a burst of joy in the direction of the cave, and Ban Ge's footsteps were much faster. He was tall and had long steps, and Mo Yi'er could only catch up with him at a trot. \"Hey, what's wrong? Why are you leaving so fast?\" \"Hurry, it seems the leader is back.\" In addition to welcoming the returning hunting tribesmen, only the leader's return can make the tribe so happy. Mo Yi'er could only follow Ban Ge's big pace and trot back all the way, feeling quite curious about the leader of this primitive tribe. Sure enough, more than twenty tribesmen gathered at the entrance of the cave. There was a burst of laughter and laughter. Several old people also left the cave and came out to greet their most beloved leader. Mo Yi'er saw a few unfamiliar faces in the crowd. One of them was tall and big, almost 190cm tall, with a dusty face, so everyone smiled at him. Mo Yi'er had a feeling that he might be the leader of this tribe. There was a woman standing next to him. She was also very muscular, about 180cm tall, with messy hair and darker skin than the men. While looking at this woman, Mo Yi'er felt a sharp gaze directed at her. The owner of Mo Yi'er's gaze was actually the tallest man. His gaze was sharp and dangerous, like that of a wild beast. \"Bang Ge, who is she!\" the man said, and everyone fell silent and followed the man's gaze to look at Mo Yi'er. Ban Ge was startled, and realized that the person he was asking was Mo Yi'er. He hurriedly answered with a smile: \"Chief Chu Yi, I was about to tell you that this is Mo Yi'er!\" \"Mo Yi'er?\" This man was indeed the leader. He called Mo Yi'er's name accurately. His eyes were full of scrutiny and full of caution, and he did not welcome this sudden person. \"Where did she come from?\" \"Don't worry, our leader! Xiao Lala saw that she fell from the sky. She is a person of the gods. She will bring good luck to the tribe!\" Kasa explained to Chu Yi with a smile, looking forward to the good luck that Mo Yi'er would bring them. Chu Yi doesn't seem to think so", "title_en": "Chapter 6"}